I think…

25:44.120 --> 25:46.600
if they push it hard enough,

25:47.120 --> 25:51.160
#BanJamie could definitely trend
to number one.

25:53.320 --> 25:55.720
Jamie should suffer a real impact.

25:57.760 --> 25:58.920
Oops.

26:00.080 --> 26:01.480
What did I just say?

26:04.280 --> 26:07.360
But you wouldn't get involved
in something like that anyway, right?

26:12.160 --> 26:16.000
Let's just forget about it.

26:39.880 --> 26:42.560
Everyone, start the war.

26:42.640 --> 26:44.920
Push the hashtag to number one.

26:45.760 --> 26:47.720
Let the whole country know.

26:47.800 --> 26:50.000
Ban Jamie!

26:50.080 --> 26:51.800
HOPE YOUR MOM GETS GROPED LIKE THIS TOO

26:51.880 --> 26:53.600
GOOD-LOOKING BUT FILTHY

26:55.120 --> 26:57.880
Save Jamie! Go!

26:57.960 --> 26:59.400
IT'S HIS DOG. WHY DOES IT BOTHER YOU?

26:59.480 --> 27:00.960
NO ONE IS BETTER THAN YOUR MOM

27:10.040 --> 27:12.040
Don't be afraid of them, dear! Fight them!

27:14.080 --> 27:16.040
Fight them!

27:44.680 --> 27:46.400
You jealous pieces of shit.

27:46.480 --> 27:50.200
You've got issues? Broken family?
Do I need to spell it out?

27:51.560 --> 27:53.600
Don't even.
You're just pretending to be nice

27:53.680 --> 27:56.000
because you want Jamie
to be your boyfriend. It's obvious.

28:02.400 --> 28:05.520
Guys, the dog farm just posted something.

28:08.120 --> 28:09.400
WE'D LIKE TO CONFIRM THIS IS TRUE

28:09.480 --> 28:11.600
MR. JAMIE PURCHASED A DOG
FROM OUR FARM ON MAY 22, 2023

28:11.680 --> 28:14.080
PLOT TWIST #BANJAMIE

28:35.800 --> 28:38.560
I've known for a while
but didn't dare speak up.

28:38.640 --> 28:40.120
I'VE KNOWN FOR A WHILE
BUT DIDN'T DARE SPEAK UP

28:40.200 --> 28:41.920
I'M READY TO BEAT HIM UP

29:17.480 --> 29:21.280
Hey, everyone. I think

29:21.360 --> 29:23.600
I found something strange.

29:27.520 --> 29:29.840
It looks like the accounts named

29:30.480 --> 29:31.640
Rrdaji,

29:35.120 --> 29:36.480
Papa Meow,

29:37.960 --> 29:39.360
God of War,

29:40.280 --> 29:42.200
Let me educate you,

29:42.280 --> 29:44.840
and Pangstop…

29:46.600 --> 29:48.360
…might all belong to the same person.

29:50.160 --> 29:51.320
Impressive, right?

29:53.280 --> 29:55.600
I posted the original source in the group.

29:55.680 --> 29:57.080
You can go say hi.

30:11.680 --> 30:12.840
- Hey!
- Follow him!

30:12.920 --> 30:14.560
- Hey!
- Where are you going?

30:14.640 --> 30:16.000
Hey!

30:20.080 --> 30:21.160
IDIOT

30:25.360 --> 30:26.280
HELLO

30:31.560 --> 30:32.480
I found you.

30:32.560 --> 30:33.600
- Damn you.
- Come here!

30:33.680 --> 30:34.800
What?!

30:36.680 --> 30:37.640
Let go!

30:37.720 --> 30:39.920
So here is where you are.
Reveal yourself.

30:40.000 --> 30:41.280
Popcorn's ready.

30:42.360 --> 30:44.000
- No!
- You're not getting away today.

30:56.760 --> 30:58.360
No!

30:58.960 --> 31:00.120
Don't!

31:01.640 --> 31:02.960
Shit!

31:03.040 --> 31:03.880
Let go!

31:07.680 --> 31:09.600
NANNO:
OOPS. A PHOTO JUST DROPPED

31:30.120 --> 31:31.240
Hey!

31:49.520 --> 31:51.840
I'LL GO TO KOSHIEN IN 5 YEARS

31:57.840 --> 31:59.080
Shit.

32:08.280 --> 32:10.000
GUYS

32:10.080 --> 32:11.800
I NEED TO SHARE THIS

32:11.880 --> 32:13.160
LET ME GET ON MY X

32:15.960 --> 32:18.440
OH, TURNS OUT IT WAS SOMEONE CLOSE

32:20.800 --> 32:22.600
THE ONE NOBODY WANTS TO BE FRIENDS WITH

32:31.240 --> 32:32.440
THE ONE WHO MAKES TRASH CONTENT

32:34.000 --> 32:34.880
ATTENTION SEEKER

32:39.240 --> 32:40.600
Damn it.

32:43.320 --> 32:44.840
YOU WANNA BE FAMOUS?

32:44.920 --> 32:47.040
I'LL HELP

32:47.120 --> 32:48.400
JAKRAPAT HONGTRAKUL
CLASS 6/4, BOWORN SCHOOL

32:51.280 --> 32:52.240
HE'S SO CRINGE

32:59.680 --> 33:01.040
Leave me alone!

33:01.120 --> 33:02.240
WHAT KIND OF FAMILY DID YOU GROW UP IN?

33:06.560 --> 33:08.600
YOU'RE A TERRIBLE PARENT

33:17.120 --> 33:18.000
PATHETIC

33:18.080 --> 33:19.120
CAN IT GET ANY WORSE THAN THIS?

33:19.200 --> 33:20.080
EXPOSE HIM

33:27.160 --> 33:28.520
Stop!

33:46.640 --> 33:48.520
Leave me alone!

33:48.600 --> 33:52.520
IT'S GOING VIRAL

33:52.600 --> 33:53.600
Damn you!

33:54.360 --> 33:56.000
Stop!

34:48.560 --> 34:49.760
Why?

34:53.440 --> 34:55.240
Even though

34:56.800 --> 34:58.160
Jamie

34:58.960 --> 35:00.960
lied to everyone

35:02.920 --> 35:05.480
and didn't even adopt that dog,

35:07.880 --> 35:10.600
why are you still helping him?

35:11.280 --> 35:12.680
Helping?

35:14.600 --> 35:16.120
Helping Jamie?

35:17.400 --> 35:20.920
No. I wasn't helping Jamie.

35:23.160 --> 35:25.600
I've been helping you all along.

35:29.160 --> 35:30.400
Helping me?

35:32.280 --> 35:33.320
Yes.

35:41.280 --> 35:44.440
IS IT HARD TO TAKE CARE OF A FEMALE DOG?
YOU HAVE TO BE CAREFUL, RIGHT?

35:50.280 --> 35:51.880
You're trying to cover it up

35:51.960 --> 35:54.520
because you really did
sexually harass your dog, right?

35:54.600 --> 35:56.080
Yeah. He should be banned.

36:00.120 --> 36:02.040
But what a surprise.

36:03.240 --> 36:05.880
You went this far.

36:08.240 --> 36:09.800
No one in class

36:10.400 --> 36:13.280
can compete with you.

36:14.800 --> 36:16.200
Hongtae,

36:16.720 --> 36:19.160
you must really love Jamie.

36:26.000 --> 36:27.080
What are you talking about?

36:27.720 --> 36:28.560
Oh?

36:29.880 --> 36:32.160
You still don't realize

36:32.240 --> 36:34.840
what the outcome of this war is?

36:55.720 --> 36:57.360
Did you really think

36:57.440 --> 36:59.840
the account of a random boy

37:00.360 --> 37:02.000
playing with a dog every day

37:02.840 --> 37:04.480
with nothing new or interesting

37:05.000 --> 37:07.400
could reach 500,000 followers on its own?

37:11.160 --> 37:12.920
What you did

37:13.000 --> 37:15.840
made everyone focus on Jamie

37:17.640 --> 37:20.960
because humans love conflict.

37:21.600 --> 37:23.400
They love violence.

37:23.480 --> 37:25.080
Right?

37:25.600 --> 37:27.160
I won't accept that!

37:27.240 --> 37:29.800
Without your hatred,

37:29.880 --> 37:32.560
Jamie wouldn't have gotten
this much attention.

37:36.840 --> 37:38.920
It was fun.

37:44.160 --> 37:45.560
Very fun.

37:48.640 --> 37:49.920
Fight them!

37:57.600 --> 37:58.840
Fight them!

38:23.560 --> 38:25.440
I finally found you.

38:28.040 --> 38:29.240
A stalker?

38:30.680 --> 38:34.720
But you could only find me online, Sky.

38:36.400 --> 38:37.560
Maybe not.

38:51.400 --> 38:52.640
Go!

39:03.760 --> 39:05.080
Anyway,

39:06.360 --> 39:07.640
in the end,

39:07.720 --> 39:11.960
this war ends with you being sacrificed.

39:13.920 --> 39:15.000
But…

39:15.520 --> 39:17.120
don't worry.

39:18.400 --> 39:20.760
You've got plenty of fellow martyrs.

39:31.800 --> 39:33.240
Everyone,

39:33.320 --> 39:36.040
I'm sorry for disappearing recently.

39:37.000 --> 39:38.760
I was seriously sick.

39:40.440 --> 39:42.160
But I'm getting better now,

39:42.680 --> 39:44.480
thanks to all of your support.

39:47.880 --> 39:49.600
There's another thing

39:49.680 --> 39:51.720
I want to tell everyone.

39:51.800 --> 39:53.400
Lately,

39:53.480 --> 39:56.720
a group of people
has been trying to defame me.

39:57.880 --> 39:59.720
So I've decided

40:00.680 --> 40:02.480
to sue both the ringleader,

40:03.000 --> 40:04.720
whom I now know the identity of,

40:05.320 --> 40:06.880
and all the followers involved.

40:08.400 --> 40:11.400
At first, I hesitated,
not sure if I should sue.

40:11.480 --> 40:14.240
But everyone told me

40:14.320 --> 40:16.080
I should set an example,

40:17.200 --> 40:18.680
so I have to do this.

40:20.480 --> 40:23.080
Thank you all so much,

40:23.160 --> 40:26.560
including the people
who sent me information.

40:26.640 --> 40:28.680
Hong says thank you too, right?

40:28.760 --> 40:30.160
Thank the fans.

40:30.240 --> 40:32.560
PANGSTOP

40:36.880 --> 40:39.200
You know that your support

40:39.280 --> 40:44.040
is the best energy for me and Hong, right?

41:21.200 --> 41:22.440
Five,

41:23.080 --> 41:24.280
four,

41:24.840 --> 41:26.480
three,

41:27.160 --> 41:28.400
two,

41:29.480 --> 41:30.880
one.

41:37.880 --> 41:39.080
Zero.

41:52.640 --> 41:54.280
Hongtae.

41:55.120 --> 41:59.080
You're the cutest anti-fan ever.

41:59.760 --> 42:01.000
Did you know that?

42:40.200 --> 42:46.480
Jamie! Jamie!

43:40.600 --> 43:42.040
It's my body.

43:42.120 --> 43:44.520
I can do whatever I want with it.
I can show whatever I want.

43:45.880 --> 43:47.240
It's my business.

43:47.320 --> 43:49.640
My body, my choice.

43:52.240 --> 43:54.000
The whole idea

43:54.080 --> 43:57.120
that our bodies belong to us

43:58.120 --> 43:59.680
is amazing.

44:02.520 --> 44:05.360
If you hadn't inspired me,

44:05.920 --> 44:08.840
we probably wouldn't be having
this much fun right now.

46:05.640 --> 46:09.640
Subtitle translation by: Panuwat Baikeawon
